OL,4,CParents in plea to reverse playground  
OL,5,Cdecline                                
OL,6,GParents are fighting to reverse a long-
OL,7,Gstanding policy which can see the      
OL,8,G"phasing out" of play parks when       
OL,9,Gageing equipment needs renewing.       
OL,11,FIn 2015, Labour-led Durham County      
OL,12,FCouncil agreed to end the use of core  
OL,13,Ffunding to upgrade some playgrounds,   
OL,14,Finstead leaving them at the mercy of   
OL,15,Fseeking cash from other sources.       
OL,17,FGeoff Knight, of the now Reform UK-led 
OL,18,Fcouncil, described budgets as "very,   
OL,19,Fvery meagre" but said there were no    
OL,20,Fclosures planned "any time soon" and   
OL,21,Fthe policy will be looked at again in  
OL,22,FMarch.                            G1/4 
OL,23,D]CNews IndexG102CFlashG150CRegionalG160
