OL,4,CDangerous driver jailed again after    
OL,5,Cvictim died                            
OL,6,GA "maniac" dangerous driver who was    
OL,7,Gjailed for seriously injuring three    
OL,8,Gpassengers in a crash has been         
OL,9,Gimprisoned again after one of his      
OL,10,Gvictims died.                          
OL,12,FBanned driver Adam Richardson, 39, was 
OL,13,Fspeeding on a wet country lane near    
OL,14,FBlackhall Colliery, County Durham, in  
OL,15,FApril 2019 when he smashed into a      
OL,16,Ftree, Teesside Crown Court heard.      
OL,18,FOne of the passengers, mother of two   
OL,19,FEmma Parkinson, was left quadriplegic  
OL,20,Fand died six years later from illness  
OL,21,Flinked to her injuries.                
OL,22,                                   G3/4 
OL,23,D]CNews IndexG102CFlashG150CRegionalG160
